# Optional server-side Admin provisioning key for BIGGBOSS accounts.
# Production Cloud Functions v2 uses Google Cloud Secret Manager (`defineSecret('BIGGBOSS_ADMIN_INITIAL_PASSWORD')`).
# Set it securely with:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set BIGGBOSS_ADMIN_INITIAL_PASSWORD
#
# For local Firebase Emulator testing ONLY, copy this file to functions/.env (gitignored):
# NEVER hardcode any Admin password in Android/Web client code or committed config files.
# BIGGBOSS_ADMIN_INITIAL_PASSWORD=set-initial-admin-password-before-deploy
# BIGGBOSS_ADMIN_KEY=replace-with-strong-16plus-char-secret

